{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546640/extras/9cba4f44cd3bc2dea06db81de11accc3.avif?t=1748951505\" width=640 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face countless perils in this challenging fast-paced runner where timing and reflexes are everything. Dodge obstacles or slash them with your sword. Perform aerial acrobatics to overcome more challenging sections. Reach your goal and discover the truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546640/extras/c0448747d74d3b64dae935122834c6b4.poster.avif?t=1748951505\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546640/extras/c0448747d74d3b64dae935122834c6b4.webm?t=1748951505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546640/extras/c0448747d74d3b64dae935122834c6b4.mp4?t=1748951505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Polaris, a powerful and agile warrior that must reach the Core of his world as soon as possible, where he will face a terrible menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546640/extras/291cc65dea124e379b4e826f4087014d.poster.avif?t=1748951505\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546640/extras/291cc65dea124e379b4e826f4087014d.webm?t=1748951505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as